== the std/yaml exercise, plain build
  == scalars and collections
    a tab after a block scalar's indentation is text
    a plain scalar's next line may start with '- ', as text
    a double- and a single-quoted scalar of 20,000 lines read in under a second
    integers, floats, null, 1.2 strings, quotes, folded, literal and verbatim tags
    '?' plain starts, block scalar blank lines and chomping, quoted folding, flow folding, tags over nothing
  
  == dump round trip
    dump reads back as the same Any; entry-like strings and << are quoted
    a byte order mark, C1 controls and 1.1 line breaks are escaped; '?a' reads back
  
  == anchors, aliases, merge
    alias, merge, explicit key wins either side of <<, properties on a root flow mapping
    << merges spaced from its ':' and in a one-pair flow mapping
  
  == streams and typed keys
    a root block scalar may start at the first column, and a document marker ends it
    a core tag on a key: !!str 1 is the string key "1"
    a 150 by 150 grid of sequences and of mappings has at least 22,000 hashes each
    parse_all, integer and boolean keys, Any as a Hash key
  
